mponents","+may not be empty or end in a space or period.","+"," ## Cargo"," "," A Cargo registry serves a sparse index at `/cargo/index/` and the crates API at","@@ -187,7 +191,7 @@ The project list at `/pypi/simple/` enumerates hosted projects only."," Uploads must be valid wheel, `.tar.gz`, or `.zip` archives. The root"," `METADATA` in a wheel's `.dist-info` directory or the root `PKG-INFO` in a"," source distribution must name the same project and version as the filename","-and upload form.","+and upload form. The decompressed archive size limit is 512 MiB."," "," Publishers can yank a file with `PUT /pypi/files/<project>/<filename>/yank`"," and a JSON body such as `{\"reason\":\"Broken release\"}`. A JSON body is required. An empty object yanks",""],"additions":5,"deletions":1,"truncated":false}],"additions":266,"deletions":57,"truncated":false,"file_count":11},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-11-22T16:22:57.704149+00:00"}